## Stock Research Page Patterns

Use these URL patterns for company-specific research pages on TipRanks.

- Stock overview page: `https://www.tipranks.com/stocks/{ticker}`
- Analyst forecast page: `https://www.tipranks.com/stocks/{ticker}/forecast`
- Earnings page: `https://www.tipranks.com/stocks/{ticker}/earnings`
- Dividend page: `https://www.tipranks.com/stocks/{ticker}/dividends`
- Ownership page: `https://www.tipranks.com/stocks/{ticker}/ownership`
- ETF exposure page: `https://www.tipranks.com/stocks/{ticker}/etf-exposure`
- Technical analysis page: `https://www.tipranks.com/stocks/{ticker}/technical-analysis`
- Options chain page: `https://www.tipranks.com/stocks/{ticker}/options-chain`
- Similar stocks page: `https://www.tipranks.com/stocks/{ticker}/similar-stocks`

For international stocks, TipRanks may use exchange prefixes in URLs, such as:

- Toronto Stock Exchange: `https://www.tipranks.com/stocks/tse:{ticker}`
- London Stock Exchange: `https://www.tipranks.com/stocks/gb:{ticker}`
- Germany: `https://www.tipranks.com/stocks/de:{ticker}`
- Singapore: `https://www.tipranks.com/stocks/sg:{ticker}`
- Hong Kong: `https://www.tipranks.com/stocks/hk:{ticker}`

